<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 6.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 6.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Friday, June 6:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,660.60 (1,636.10)	CHF  1,150.50 (1,132.40)</p>
<p>    DEM    961.05 (945.45)	  GBP  2,705.90 (2,662.10)</p>
<p>    ATS    136.62 (134.36)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Thursday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $19.20 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$12.26 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $31.46 million ($23.97 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
